{"steam_appid":813230,"steam_name":"ANIMAL WELL","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/813230/671218/4d8ae53ccb68b78247874236d27d39a2c8617e3c/1750586027/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1710703946","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257005943/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1710703946","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813230/ss_87a9f2941e114a2bb834db6350ccbedc1ade794d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776365443","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813230/ss_ca955f6bb4f0c164dcffa59082ae985fb530582a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776365443","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813230/ss_6c242925256158897426f3e90e7e8a8f8f0bbee9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776365443","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813230/ss_f9f088275737d81e0eb998e0c076282c5c1955c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776365443","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813230/ss_e8450943c2393103ef5e51d9c968c3ae1a610a55.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776365443"],"about_the_game":"Hatch from your flower and spelunk through the beautiful and sometimes haunting world of Animal Well, a pixelated wonder rendered in intricate audio and visual detail. Encounter lively creatures small and large, helpful and ominous as you discover unconventional upgrades and unravel the well’s secrets. This is a truly unique experience that can make you laugh in fear, surprise, or delight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813230/extras/24d6011d0b6a3f6108c3024bb78c0076.poster.avif?t=1776365443\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/813230/extras/24d6011d0b6a3f6108c3024bb78c0076.webm?t=1776365443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st